response:
The report describes a cyberattack targeting Ukrainian state organizations using a malicious PowerPoint document (Доповідь_050722_4.ppt) referencing the Ukrainian Operational Command South. When macros are enabled, the document drops and executes intermediate components (gksg023ig.lnk, sgegkseg23mjl.exe) using rundll32.exe. The obfuscated .NET executable sgegkseg23mjl.exe downloads an image containing steganographic data from onyangdol.site to extract and execute MCMDiction.exe, which ultimately deploys the AgentTesla stealer malware.

